Stormy is often noted as the weapon to lock away and forget.

Even in Sporkhack there's only one foe I wield Stormy against and
that's just while tossing daggers.

In the sources everybody fears Stormbringer, so why not bring that to
the game in two ways.

Invoking Stormbringer causes a scare monsters as if reading the
scroll.

And draining a level with Stormbringer causes the target to suffer a
scare check as if Magicbane had struck it.

That still leaves a lot of high level nasties that Stormy still won't
do squat to, but at least it'll sometimes be worth lugging around.


